1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,200
BOBO: WHAT IS THAT?!

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,200
BOBO: Ooh. Shiny.

3
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,400
MAX: Bobo. Back away.

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,700
MAX: DO NOT TOUCH IT!

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,400
BOBO: This little thing?

6
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:17,700
MAX: YES. THAT.

7
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:21,500
BOBO: JUST ONE LITTLE PRESS…

8
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,300
MAX: Absolutely not.

9
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,400
BOBO: A tiny one?

10
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,600
MAX: Do. Not. Even.

11
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,800
MAX: BOBOOOOO!

12
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,400
BOBO: That seems normal.

13
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,500
MAX: NOT NORMAL!

14
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,500
MAX: I BLAME YOUUU!

15
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,500
BOBO: Max? Buddy?

16
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:47,600
BOBO: Behind the button?

17
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,500
BOBO: Oh, this is bad.

18
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:54,000
BOBO: I can fix this.

19
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,400
MAX: Do. Not. Laugh.

20
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:01,400
BOBO: You look… different.

21
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:04,000
MAX: I AM A BANANA.

22
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:08,800
BOBO: Can I eat you?

23
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,700
MAX: BOBO! NO!
